---
title: cadence
summary: Open-source budgeting app for multi-partner projects with multiyear cashflow.
stack: Django, Django Ninja, PostgreSQL
repo: https://github.com/jplej/cadence-budget
status: development
---

Budget management for partnership structures where traditional accounting doesn't apply.
Built for co-productions, artistic projects, and anyone managing shared finances across
multiple partners — with forecast vs realized tracking, cost-sharing splits, and
profit distribution waterfalls.

Early alpha. API-first, no UI yet.
